  "content": "\n\n# Tschipcraft 的 Make Bubbles Pop\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod?logo=github&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 星星數\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/605235?logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"CurseForge 下載數\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/total?logo=github&colorA=363a4f&colorB=b7bdf8&style=for-the-badge\" title=\"GitHub 下載數\"></a>\n\n> 適用於 Minecraft 1.18.x-26.2.x 的模組\n\n## 🫧 功能特色\n\n此客戶端模組會使氣泡粒子破裂，並全面重構其行為邏輯，讓它們能真實地上升至水面。\n此外，它還為開啟箱子、開啟木桶以及水下爆炸等情境增添了氣泡粒子效果。\n\n修復了 [MC-132067](https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-132067)。\n\n\n## 🔧 安裝方式\n\n下載最新版本，並將 `.jar` 檔案放入 Minecraft 目錄中的 `mods` 資料夾內。\n\n若要設定 Make Bubbles Pop，請一併安裝 Fabric 版的 [MidnightLib](https://modrinth.com/mod/midnightlib) 或 Forge 版的 [Configured](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured)。\n\n\n## 📺 展示影片\n\n<details>\n<summary>重構後的氣泡粒子行為（方塊互動）</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/make_bubbles_pop/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/make_bubbles_pop/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>重構後的氣泡粒子行為（實體互動）</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/bubble_entity_interactions.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/bubble%20behavior.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>三叉戟拖尾</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/trident%20trail.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/trident%20trail.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>在水下開啟箱子</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/chest%20bubbles.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/chest%20bubbles.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>水下爆炸</summary>\n<video src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/explosion%20bubbles.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/fabric_make_bubbles_pop_mod/master/demo/explosion%20bubbles.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>與原版對比：靈魂沙</summary>\n<video src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437539-a666994e-2a25-4b80-aecd-240b1a979cfd.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437539-a666994e-2a25-4b80-aecd-240b1a979cfd.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>與原版對比：釣魚</summary>\n<video src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437560-0935de11-5b12-41b2-abe8-cafc7bb86d1d.mp4\" width=\"55%\" height=\"auto\" controls>您的瀏覽器不支援影片標籤，或該影片已不存在。<a href=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/78470530/161437560-0935de11-5b12-41b2-abe8-cafc7bb86d1d.mp4\">點擊此處觀看影片</a></video>\n</details>\n\n\n## 🗺️ 規劃中功能\n\n- 原生 NeoForge 支援\n\n\n## 🧩 相容性\n\n<img title=\"Supported Minecraft versions\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.3.x&supported_versions=1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x&total_versions=%3C=1.16.x,1.17.x,1.18.x,1.19.x,1.20.x,1.21.x,26.1.x,26.2.x,26.3.x&progress_bar=false&mc_background=false&icons=true&platform=modrinth\">\n\n**Forge** 僅支援至 Minecraft 1.21.5。\n\n**NeoForge** 目前尚無原生支援，但若搭配 [Sinytra Connector](https://modrinth.com/mod/connector) 安裝，則可在 NeoForge 環境下運行 Fabric 版的 Make Bubbles Pop。\n\n目前不建議將 [Particle Tweaks](https://modrinth.com/mod/particle-tweaks) 與 Make Bubbles Pop 同時安裝。\n\n\n## 🔗 外部連結\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"CurseForge logo\" title=\"在 CurseForge 查看 Make Bubbles Pop\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Tschipcraft/badges/main/assets/curseforge-modrinth.svg\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/mod/make-bubbles-pop-fabric/\">\n<img width=\"40px\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft logo\" title=\"在 PlanetMinecraft 查看 Make Bubbles Pop\" src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-128.png\">\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/en/make_bubbles_pop.html\">\n<picture>\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n  <source width=\"40px\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://tschipcraft.ddns.net/assets/images/logo-black-1.svg\">\n  <img width=\"40px\" title=\"在我的網站查看 Make Bubbles Pop\" src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/dd29a827fa843ed52e7efc7801c48421/raw/7ab31174b119403a1deff072e3ae16fe43a9ed59/website_logo_modrinth.svg\">\n</picture>\n</a>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/C0C5HEJB2\">\n<img width=\"250px\" title=\"在 Ko-fi 支持我\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_button_blue.png\">\n</a>\n\n\n## 🤝 合作夥伴優惠\n\n想要購買 **Hytale** 或升級版本嗎？結帳時輸入推薦代碼 \\`Tschipcraft\\`，我將獲得佣金！（您的價格維持不變）\n\n<a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2611\">\n<img title=\"透過在 Sparked Host 購買伺服器支持我（此為聯盟行銷連結）\" src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\">\n</a>",
